 "category_en": "Mountain scenery",
 "intro_zh": "长江采石矶文化生态旅游区是一个集文化欣赏、自然观光和休闲散步等功能为一体的综合型风景区。区域内以诗仙李白为灵魂，以深厚的历史文化为底蕴，以“翠螺浮大江”的山岳型景观为特色，建有采石矶、太白楼、谪仙园、林散之艺术馆、三元洞、延园、圆梦园、万竹坞、三台阁等著名景点。",
 "intro_en": "Yangtze River Caishiji Cultural Ecological Tourism Area is a comprehensive scenic area integrating cultural appreciation, natural sightseeing and leisure walks. With the poet Li Bai as the soul, the profound historical culture as the foundation, and the mountainous landscape of \"Cuiluo Floating River\" as the feature, the area has famous scenic spots such as Caishiji, Taibai Tower, Banished Immortal Garden, Lin Sanzhi Art Museum, Sanyuan Cave, Yanyuan Garden, Yuanmengyuan Garden, Wanzhuwu, and Santai Pavilion.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
